\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \tab The Church's one foundation is Jesus Christ her Lord:
\par \pard\li720 She is His new creation
\par By water and the word;
\par From heaven He came and sought her
\par To be His holy bride;
\par With His own blood He bought her,
\par And for her life He died.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab Elect from every nation,
\par \pard\li720 Yet one o'er all the earth,
\par Her charter of salvation
\par One Lord, one faith, one birth,
\par One holy name she blesses,
\par Partakes one holy food,
\par And to one hope she presses,
\par With every grace endued.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab Though with a scornful wonder
\par \pard\li720 Men see her sore oppressed,
\par By schisms rent asunder,
\par By heresies distressed ;
\par Yet saints their watch are keeping,
\par Their cry goes up :How long ?
\par And soon the night of weeping 
\par Shall be the morn of song.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab Mid toil and tribulation,
\par \pard\li720 And tumult of her war,
\par She waits the consummation
\par Of peace for evermore,
\par Till with the vision glorious
\par Her longing eyes are blest,
\par And the great Church victorious
\par Shall be the Church at rest.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.\tab Yet she on earth hath union
\par \pard\fi360\li360 With God the Three in one,
\par \pard\li720 And mystic sweet communion
\par With those whose rest is won.
\par O happy ones and holy !
\par Lord, give us grace that we,
\par Like them, the meek and lowly,
\par On high may dwell with Thee.
\par Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

